<title>UK: Germany's Triumph Adler to raise 100mln dm.</title>
<headline>Germany's Triumph Adler to raise 100mln dm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>German consumer products group Triumph Adler AG plans to raise 100 million marks through a one-for-four capital increase this month to help finance up to 500 million marks of acquisitions, London's Financial Times newspaper said.</p>
<p>Chairman Raimund Konig said he had identified 500 million marks of purchases for existing divisions and was not averse to adding a new business area, the newspaper reported.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7717</p>
